[[Summit Giant Herder]]s are [[Stone Summit]] that have enslaved [[snow beast]]s for use as war mounts, manipulating them through the use of a complex harness made up of chains and manacles.  These "mounts" are guided through brute strength and the threat of pain rather than the traditional, time-consuming methods of breaking and training.  Thus the beast's dying scream is always one of rage, not pain.

