==Notes==
*They have 540 [[health]].
*[[Pain Inverter]] is very useful against them before they use [[Giant Stomp]], as it will trigger damage for every ally knocked down, as well as any nearby foes that happen to be knocked down.
*Summit Giant Herders have a visual animation when activating Giant Stomp. Watch for the animation when predicting to interrupt the skill or when you should cast spells.
*This creature has a [[miniature]] [[Miniature Summit Giant Herder|version]].

